sequenceDiagram
  actor E as Employee
  participant B as Browser
  participant F as Flask (routes_staff)
  participant BL as billing.py
  participant DB as SQLite
  actor C as Customer
  E->>B: Select meter, enter current reading
  B->>F: GET /staff/api/meters/{id}
  F->>DB: SELECT last reading
  DB-->>F: previous value
  F-->>B: JSON (previous reading)
  B-->>E: Show consumption live
  E->>B: Save Reading
  B->>F: POST /staff/readings/new
  F->>DB: INSERT meter_readings
  alt reading lower than previous
    DB-->>F: trg_reading_monotonic ABORT
    F-->>B: Error message, nothing saved
  else valid reading
    F->>BL: generate_bill(reading_id)
    BL->>DB: SELECT tariff + slabs
    BL->>DB: INSERT bills, bill_items
    DB->>DB: trg_bill_notify (notify customer)
    F->>DB: COMMIT
    F-->>B: Redirect to Bill Details
  end
  C->>B: Pay bill (UPI)
  B->>F: POST /my/bills/{id}/pay
  F->>DB: INSERT payments
  DB->>DB: trg_no_overpay check, then trg_payment_status (bill -> paid, notify)
  F-->>B: Payment successful, receipt no.
